Third-party notices
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

No third-party libraries, fonts, images, music or trackers are bundled.
All visuals are drawn at runtime with inline SVG and Canvas, and all audio is
synthesised with the Web Audio API. System fonts are used for typography.
